---
// Philosophy Section Component
---

<section id="philosophy" class="philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="philosophy-content motion-rise">
      <h2>Gardens designed to be peaceful, bountiful and beautiful</h2>
      
      <p>
        We believe productive gardens can also feel calm, elevated, and easy. Every Verdant Grove installation is designed to support the rhythms of home life while bringing structure and beauty to the landscape.
      </p>

      <div class="philosophy-values">
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Peaceful</h3>
          <p>Creating spaces that bring tranquility and ease to your daily routines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Bountiful</h3>
          <p>Gardens that provide abundant harvests and seasonal joy year-round.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Beautiful</h3>
          <p>Thoughtfully designed spaces that are as lovely to look at as they are productive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="philosophy-link-wrap"><a href="/about#philosophy">Read our full philosophy</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy {
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45, 80, 22, 0.05) 0%, rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.05) 100%);
  }

  .philosophy-content {
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .philosophy h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .philosophy-content > p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-light-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  .philosophy-values {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .value {
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-sm);
    border-radius: 0;
    border-left: none;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .value h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .value p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-light-text);
  }

  .philosophy-link-wrap {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .philosophy-link-wrap a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .philosophy-values {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
